    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "MAX",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105574895967590556516/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWA6NX43HplJPN6mHSreq-eLahYjcZUsGhkRfhv3ok9nKpOsL4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "I was extremely satisfied with the service at this mechanics! Garrett was able to take me last minute for a winter tire change and he was super friendly. I tried calling multiple garages to help me out with my situation, but no one was able to take me so last minute or do it as cost effective as him! The job was done quickly and well. Thanks again! I highly recommend them.",
        "time": 1745962222,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "YOUSSEF ESSATE",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100288441995676183709/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWY8BfD4KRInbFO55-W50BLRKykuWypEyZsjGwch0TsTsf9c_4Z=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Dishonest Pricing – Beware!\n\nI took my vehicle to this garage for a shock inspection and repair, and they initially quoted me a price. However, they suddenly claimed I needed to pay more . At that point, I had no choice but to agree since they had already started working on my car. This kind of bait-and-switch pricing is completely unprofessional and unfair to customers. I would not recommend this shop to anyone looking for honest service.",
        "time": 1742156200,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Youssef Amsabri Amsabri",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107141852922901832559/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJOmRKFJr-1x8GU04o4gt51NqAW9Tz2VWkrShdkw--MLlkmKQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Avoid this place at all costs—they’re ripping people off. I needed to change my brakes, and the mechanic quoted me less than $700 for both the front and back. When I went to get them fixed, I found out that he had also replaced the caliper, which costs $50 on Amazon, but he charged me $250 because he said he had to drive to get it on Saturday. I had called him on Friday to ask if they could fix it on Saturday, and he said they were open. Then today, he handed me a bill for $1,050. I can’t understand how they justify charging people this much and calling it a “good deal”—it’s outright theft. In the end, I paid $650 just for the back brakes. My roommate has a 2015 Jeep Cherokee and replaced everything for $700, but this guy charged me $650 for only the back. Absolutely ridiculous.",
        "time": 1742072110,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Everton Elliott",
